        "accordion_Ep8WBc": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "Credit & Debit Cards",
            "accordion_id": "credit-debit-cards",
            "num_logos": 4,
            "logo_1": "shopify://shop_images/full_97ce48b9-3f4b-4123-a700-c26e925e484f.png",
            "logo_2": "shopify://shop_images/full_27e380fb-7953-4950-a6f2-65dd168bcaf1.png",
            "logo_3": "shopify://shop_images/full_2260f798-ea2b-4074-8ee2-df0a52d1849b.png",
            "logo_4": "shopify://shop_images/full_119b3192-33ba-4200-bc22-0b8a775a693c.png",
            "accordion_content": "<p>We welcome Visa, MasterCard, Discover, and American Express. Safely input your credit card details through our secure online checkout powered by Stripe.</p><p>Alternatively, place your order over the phone, or request an emailed pre-filled credit card form by contacting us at 925-430-6111.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_U46Nt4": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "Leasing & Financing",
            "accordion_id": "leasing-financing",
            "num_logos": 5,
            "logo_1": "shopify://shop_images/full_07131c56-b0e0-44cc-b070-544e9664846a.png",
            "logo_2": "shopify://shop_images/full_7e5a5c2d-3e93-4dbc-add4-bc4f7bbe2925.png",
            "logo_3": "shopify://shop_images/full_4263c4df-d962-4289-a874-4cee880bc9fb.png",
            "logo_4": "shopify://shop_images/full_ea0de5b3-1ba8-44a5-9202-def61ae7c757.png",
            "logo_5": "shopify://shop_images/full_505d85e7-8156-4410-a027-c4bc1b4ad9fc.png",
            "accordion_content": "<p>Enjoy the convenience and installment offerings of our partner online payment portals! Simply select the payment portal of your choice below the \"Proceed to Checkout\" option, and choose your installment plan.</p><p>View our comparison chart here to discover which financing option is best for you.</p><p>Explore comprehensive financing options for your commercial gym or fitness facility through Geneva Capital. Learn more about their terms and conditions here.</p><p>View our comparison chart here to discover which financing option is best for you.</p><ol><li>Geneva Capital is only available for businesses, thus requiring a separate financing application process directly through their Sales Manager. The other options mentioned above are available upon online checkout.</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_fJzeyV": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "PayPal & Venmo",
            "accordion_id": "paypal-venmo",
            "num_logos": 2,
            "logo_1": "shopify://shop_images/full_7e5a5c2d-3e93-4dbc-add4-bc4f7bbe2925.png",
            "logo_2": "shopify://shop_images/full_a6147870-fa14-4e3b-92b8-bceea1aa60dd.png",
            "accordion_content": "<p><strong>PayPal</strong></p><ul><li>Conveniently pay using PayPal Express Checkout or eChecks.</li><li>Pay in installments of 6 months, 12 months, or 24 months through PayMonthly</li><li>Installments offered for purchases worth $199 up to $10,000*</li><li>for PayPal eligible clients and purchases</li></ul><p><a href=\"/pages/terms-conditions\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"/pages/terms-conditions\">Learn more about PayPal's terms & conditions here &gt;</a></p><p><strong>Venmo</strong></p><p>Easily make purchases by paying through Venmo during a mobile PayPal checkout</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_wmwrC6": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "Amazon Pay, Apple Pay, & Google Pay",
            "accordion_id": "amazon-apple-google-pay",
            "num_logos": 3,
            "logo_1": "shopify://shop_images/full_c717d105-d0ea-41f3-ac20-22a2a22abfa7.png",
            "logo_2": "shopify://shop_images/full_da8060ed-01fd-4520-88b3-2ee03fa003e9.png",
            "logo_3": "shopify://shop_images/full_3d4c749c-6c18-46d3-b9ac-1543563e3875.png",
            "accordion_content": "<p><strong>Amazon Pay</strong></p><p>Conveniently use Amazon Pay through our online checkout on the Shopping Cart page.</p><p><strong>Apple Pay</strong></p><p>Easily pay the Apple way upon checkout for a safe and secure transaction.</p><p><strong>Google Pay</strong></p><p>Seamlessly pay through Google Pay when you checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_8y9Ejm": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "Bank Transfers & Checks",
            "accordion_id": "bank-transfers",
            "num_logos": 0,
            "accordion_content": "<p><strong>Electronic Check (E-Check)/ Checking Account</strong></p><p>Utilize E-Check payments through PayPal or contact us directly for assistance.</p><p><strong>Checks</strong></p><ul><li>We accept personal checks, cashier's checks, and money orders</li><li>Opt for 'check by mail' during online checkout, with details provided upon order submission</li><li>Contact us at <a href=\"tel:925-430-6111\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:925-430-6111\">925-430-6111</a> or via email at <a href=\"mailto:info@frenchfitness.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@frenchfitness.com\">info@frenchfitness.com</a> for alternative payment instructions</li></ul><ol><li>Items won't be reserved until the check tracking number has been received and acknowledged by our team. The order lead time will not commence until the action check is obtained by our office</li></ol><p><strong>Wire Transfers/ACH</strong></p><ul><li>We accept wire transfers from any bank account</li><li>Select 'wire transfer' during online checkout, with details provided upon order submission</li><li>Contact us at <a href=\"tel:925-430-6111\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:925-430-6111\">925-430-6111</a> or via email at <a href=\"mailto:info@frenchfitness.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@frenchfitness.com\">info@frenchfitness.com</a> for alternative payment instructions</li></ul><ol><li>Items won't be reserved until the payment is received, verified, and processed</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_dXpeKi": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "Cash & Purchase Orders",
            "accordion_id": "cash-orders",
            "num_logos": 0,
            "accordion_content": "<p><strong>Cash</strong></p><p>Accepted for local sales only. Connect with us at 925-430-6111 or via email for cash payment inquiries</p><p><strong>Purchase Orders</strong></p><ul><li>Government agencies can seamlessly complete orders through purchase orders</li><li>Reach out at <a href=\"tel:925-430-6111\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"tel:925-430-6111\">925-430-6111</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:info@frenchfitness.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:info@frenchfitness.com\">info@frenchfitness.com</a> for further details</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_GqtmgP": {
