    "tab_information_ry8LjM": {
      "type": "tab-information",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_eDgCUm": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "<p>US Territories, California, Canada</p>",
            "tab_content": "<p><strong>California, Wisconsin & New Jersey Buyers</strong></p><p>For California buyers, sales tax will be calculated based on the combined state, county, and district rates, which ranges from 7.25% to 10.25%. 5% sales tax will be charged for Wisconsin buyers and 6.625% will be charged to New Jersey buyers upon checkout. Customers from other states in the US will not be charged a sales tax.</p><p><strong>US Territories Buyers</strong></p><p>No additional fees will be charged upon delivery. Our online checkout price includes door-to-door shipping to your address, which amount to 10.5% for Puerto Rico and 4% for Guam. No taxes for USVI.</p><p><strong>Canada Buyers</strong></p><ul><li>Ontario: 13%</li><li>Atlantic provinces (Newfoundland, Nova Scotia, New Brunswick, PEI): 15%</li><li>All other provinces (Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, Northwest Territories, Nunavut, Quebec, Saskatchewan, Yukon): 5%</li></ul>",
            "tab_image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_25a28f66-8f31-45aa-aa8f-9796a1fa00fb.png"
          }
        },
        "richtext_nep3YV": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "<p>Other Countries</p>",
            "tab_content": "<p><strong>Large Shipments Outside USA, Canada, & US Territories</strong></p><ul><li>Customers are responsible for all import, border, brokerage, duty, customs, port fees, VAT, GST, and other taxes and fees applied by their country.</li><li>Customers are responsible for transportation from the ocean port to their final delivery location.</li><li>Our website provides a quotation for CIF terms to the largest port in the country of destination. Should you prefer DDP or EXW terms, please contact us to receive a custom quotation. </li><li>We can ship to most ports in your country. However, any ports other than the largest, will require a quote, which you can email, chat, or call our team for.</li><li>French Fitness can assist in providing the necessary paperwork that may be required in transit or in the port of entry. You may contact us for further guidance.<br/><br/>Email: info@frenchfitness.com<br/>Phone: (925) 430-6111<br/></li></ul><p><strong>Small Parcels Outside USA, Canada, & US Territories</strong></p><p>Fees to be computed and paid upon online checkout. Shipped via FedEx straight to your address. No additional fees.</p>",
            "tab_image": "shopify://shop_images/waist-up-portrait-handsome-serious-unshaven-male-keeps-hands-together-dressed-dark-blue-shirt-has-talk-with-interlocutor-stands-against-white-wall-self-confident-man-freelancer_1_cbc1f036-3d05-4572-b48d-dd4a6c719dea.png"
          }
        },
        "richtext_kaJ7d8": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "<p>Special Conditions</p>",
            "tab_content": "<p><strong>Tax Exempt</strong></p><p>Buyers residing in California and qualified for tax exemption may call us to place an order without tax.</p><p>Phone: (925) 430-6111</p>",
            "tab_image": "shopify://shop_images/waist-up-portrait-handsome-serious-unshaven-male-keeps-hands-together-dressed-dark-blue-shirt-has-talk-with-interlocutor-stands-against-white-wall-self-confident-man-freelancer_1_1_22857063-a961-4daa-afc2-719bcdd1da1a.png"
          }
        }
      },
