    "payment_faqs_nqby4G": {
      "type": "payment-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_VcwdxC": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>I am having problems placing an order on your website. The order was declined.</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<ul><li><strong>Data input error:</strong></li></ul><ol><li>Make sure that the billing address matches your actual billing statement’s address, and your CVV is correct</li><li>Ensure that the phone number and email address are entered correctly in the appropriate fields. “Evening Phone” should be left blank if you are providing only one phone number.</li><li>Make sure that the shipping address entered is a valid address.</li></ol><ul><li><strong>Credit card error:</strong> If everything is entered correctly, there may be an issue with your credit card.</li></ul><ol><li>Most credit card issuers impose a daily spending limit or a spending limit per transaction. You may simply call your credit card company to request for a temporary limit increase in order for your transaction to push through. Otherwise, you may need to try a different card or payment method.</li><li>Our merchant card provider uses an automatic filter to decline potentially fraudulent transactions. Feel free to call us at 925-430-6111 to review and complete your purchase.<br/></li></ol><ul><li><strong>Browser-related issue:</strong></li></ul><ol><li>It could be a technical problem on our end. Get in touch with us at 925-430-6111 so we can assist you better. Our sales representatives are on the line daily from 6 AM to 6 PM Pacific Standard Time. They can process payments by phone or send secure credit card forms for online checkout.</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_ttaqkz": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>I want to pay by credit card but do not feel comfortable entering the information online / I am having difficulties completing my payment online. Is there another way to settle my transaction?</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<p>We can complete your payment by phone or send you a pre-filled payment form. Feel free to call us at 925-430-6111. We are available 7 days a week, 6 AM to 6 PM.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_bjYRNb": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>I want to pay using two payment methods and the website only allows me to enter one.</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<p>Get in touch with us at 925-430-6111 so we can use your preferred payment methods either by phone or through a secure payment form.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_agHW97": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>Why do I need to provide my phone number on checkout? Most companies do not require this information.</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<p>Deliveries of small parcels facilitated through FedEx and UPS do not need to contact you to schedule a delivery, however freight carriers and moving companies used to ship large equipment will need to set a delivery date and time with you. This is likewise an extra measure Fitness Superstore takes to protect our customers from fraud or suspicious transactions.</p><p>Customer privacy is extremely important to us. Rest assured that your phone number and other personal information will only be used for the transaction it is associated with. For more information, you may refer to our Privacy Policy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_gc8yKB": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>I placed an order and upon logging in, the order status says “Processing”. What does this mean?</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<p>This means that we have received your order and we are working on packaging it. Until the items are shipped out, the status will reflect “Processing”. Should you need to know the specific status of your order, feel free to call us at 925-430-6111 or reach us via email.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_FYzETR": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>I placed an order and the information on the receipt is incorrect and needs to be changed, and/or I was billed incorrectly.</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<p>Please call us at 925-430-6111 or Email Us as soon as you recognize the error. We will promptly look into the issue.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_yHKKp7": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>I placed an order and need to cancel.</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<p>Please call us at 925-430-6111 or Email Us as soon as possible. We can only cancel your order prior to shipment. Otherwise, please refer to our Return Policy for more information.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_dKLXKe": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_title": "<p>How can I reach a live representative if I have an urgent concern?</p>",
            "accordion_content": "<p>Get in touch with us at 925-430-6111 anytime from 6 AM to 6 PM Pacific Standard Time. You may also email us at info@frenchfitness.com.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
